t management, and remote monitoring; customer technical support and repair services; optimization consulting services; and training services, as well as spare parts. The company sells its products through independent distributors in relation to its direct sales force. It serves discrete end markets, including automotive, semiconductor, e-commerce, and warehouse automation; hybrid end markets, such as food and beverage, household and personal care, and life sciences; and process end markets, including energy, mining, and chemicals. The company was formerly known as Rockwell International Corporation and changed its name to Rockwell Automation, Inc. in February 2002. Rockwell Automation, Inc. was founded in 1903 and is headquartered in Milwaukee, Wisconsin.","employees":27000,"website":"https://www.rockwellautomation.com","country":"United States","city":"Milwaukee","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Blake D. Moret","title":"President, Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Ms. Rebecca W. House J.D.","title":"Senior VP, Chief People & Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary"},{"name":"Mr. Scott A. Genereux","title":"Senior Vice President"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.85,"tpe":25.47,"ps":2.105,"pfcf":27.0,"peg":1.42,"pb":3.568,"ev_ebitda":14.39,"rev_growth":0.12,"eps_growth":0.177,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1604,"eps_growth_next":0.1417,"div_yield":0.0072,"roe":0.1435,"roa":0.05684,"de":67.22,"gross_margin":0.3218,"op_margin":0.1195,"profit_margin":0.0738,"current_ratio":1.732},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":23.23,"sector":17.85,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":31.0,"sector":25.47,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":4.76,"sector":2.105,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":31.78,"sector":27.0,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":2.36,"sector":1.42,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":12.06,"sector":3.568,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)